## Design: Milestone 3 — Event Config API + Landing Page

### Scope
Greenfield: monorepo (frontend/ + backend/), SQLite, Express, React+Vite+Tailwind.

### Backend

**Database** — `EventConfig` table in SQLite:
| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | INTEGER PK | singleton row |
| event_date | TEXT (ISO) | |
| event_title | TEXT | |
| event_description | TEXT | markdown |
| rules | TEXT | markdown |
| scoring_categories | TEXT | JSON array |
| landing_page_content | TEXT | markdown |
| judge_password_hash | TEXT | bcrypt, excluded from public GET |
| team_password_hash | TEXT | bcrypt, excluded from public GET |

**Routes:**
- `GET /api/config` — public, returns all fields except passwords
- `PUT /api/config` — admin auth (JWT), hashes `judge_password`/`team_password` on save via bcrypt

**Auth:** Admin login returns JWT stored in localStorage. Middleware checks `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.

### Frontend

**Pages:**
- `LandingPage.tsx` — Hero with live countdown (useEffect + setInterval), "What is this?" card, rules card with "NO BURGERS" pill, Register CTA, Join Global Chat button, Footer
- `admin/EventSettings.tsx` — Form with fields for all EventConfig, markdown textareas for description/rules/content, scoring_categories list editor, calls PUT /api/config

**Shared components (`components/ui/`):**
- `Navbar` — site title + nav links (responsive: top bar mobile, side drawer desktop)
- `Footer` — host info, event date from config
- `Toast` — Zustand store, auto-dismiss
- `Spinner` — loading state

**Design tokens** — Tailwind config from `DESIGN.md`: colors, fonts (Montserrat/Inter), spacing scale, rounded-2xl cards, crust-border, festive-shadow.

### Testing
- Backend: manual curl tests for GET/PUT endpoints
- Frontend: verify countdown renders, form submits, design matches mockups

---

